      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "This subclass includes:\n- products which serve as a portable platforms for the assembly of a quantity of goods to form a unit load for handling, transportation and storage by mechanical appliances.\nIt also includes:\n- platforms, post platforms, collar type box platforms, side rail platforms and end rail platforms.\n- collars made up of four pieces of wood, usually with hinges on the ends to form a frame that is placed over the pallet itself.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "本子类包括：\n- 用作可携式平台的产品，用于将一定数量的货物组合成单元载荷，以便通过机械设备进行搬运、运输和储存。\n\n还包括：\n- 平台、立柱平台、围板箱式平台、侧栏平台和端栏平台，\n- 由四块木板组成的围板，通常在两端装有铰链，用于形成一个框架，放置在托盘本体之上。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
